flowchart LR
    PC["PC<br/>8-bit instruction address"] -->|address| IMEM["Instruction memory<br/>256 × 16"]
    IMEM -->|16-bit instruction| DEC["Decode & control"]
    DEC -->|opcode / control| CTRL["Control signals"]
    DEC -->|operand| OP["8-bit operand"]

    A["Accumulator A<br/>8 bits"] --> ALU["ALU<br/>8-bit addition"]
    OP -->|immediate| ALU
    DMEM["Data memory<br/>256 × 8"] -->|read byte| ALU
    ALU -->|sum| WB["Accumulator input select"]
    DMEM -->|load value| WB
    OP -->|LDI value| WB
    WB --> A

    OP -->|address for LDA / STA / ADD| DMEM
    A -->|store value| DMEM
    CTRL -->|write enable| DMEM

    PC --> NEXT["Next-PC select"]
    OP -->|jump target| NEXT
    A --> ZERO["A == 0?"]
    ZERO --> NEXT
    CTRL --> NEXT
    NEXT --> PC
